---
interface Props {repositoryUrl:string}
const {repositoryUrl}=Astro.props;
const archived=repositoryUrl.includes('/servers-archived/');
---
<div class="security-review"><div class="notice"><strong>Review status: Not independently verified</strong><p>No automated or manual security assessment is recorded for this listing. Repository ownership, dependencies, runtime behavior and permissions have not been audited by FreeMCP.</p></div>{archived&&<div class="archived"><strong>Archived collection link</strong><p>This listing links to a repository path named <code>servers-archived</code>. Confirm its current maintenance and installation guidance before use.</p></div>}<h3>Before enabling this server</h3><ul><li>Inspect requested filesystem, network, database and API permissions.</li><li>Check dependency versions, license and recent maintainer activity.</li><li>Prefer least-privilege credentials and restrict access to sensitive resources.</li><li>Test in an isolated environment before granting production access.</li><li>Review exposed tools and confirm destructive actions require approval.</li></ul><p class="disclaimer">This checklist is general guidance, not a security certification or a claim that these checks were performed.</p></div>
